  "question": {
    "text": "A square Lamina OABC of length 10 cm is pivoted at 'O'. Forces act at Lamina as shown in figure. If Lamina remains stationary, then the magnitude of F is :<br/><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/4ek7q41IItuzH0HWKkyyna27TwW1B7rF-8SNCcLpXqo.original.fullsize.png\"/>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "UToAI",
      "text": "20 N",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "62k4g",
      "text": "0 (zero)",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "FibhO",
      "text": "10 N",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
    {
      "id": "8Um7A",
      "text": "$10 \\sqrt{2} \\mathrm{~N}$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Since the lamina is equilibrium.<br/>$\\therefore \\mathrm{F}_{\\mathrm{net}}=0 \\& \\tau_{\\mathrm{net}}=0$<br/><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/mS33k-RgAo-F_Sm5FnsacPu8uWB9pUBF3kg7lNraLlI.original.fullsize.png\"/><br/>$\\mathrm{T}_{\\mathrm{o}}=10 \\ell-\\mathrm{F} \\ell \\Rightarrow \\mathrm{F}=10 \\mathrm{~N}$",
    "image": null
  },
